        },
        {
          "paragraph": 1,
          "fragments": [
            {
              "scan": "s105",
              "printed_page": "38",
              "text": "Therefore do all His creatures glorify and bless God, praise, honour and grandeur do they offer to God, the King, the Creator of all, who has bestowed rest as an inheritance upon His people Israel in His holiness on the Holy Sabbath day. Thy Name. O Lord our God, be sanctified and Thy memory, O our King, be glorified in heaven above and on the earth below. Blessed art Thou, our Helper, for the glory of Thy handiwork and for the radiant lights that Thou hast made, they shall praise Thee, Selah.",
